    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_trade_02_01",
      "hash64": "6C30F7D69AC9FA69",
      "text": "You can’t trade Ms. Raifort a Pokémon if you\\naren’t its original Trainer!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_trade_02_02",
      "hash64": "6C30F4D69AC9F550",
      "text": "You can’t trade Ms. Raifort such a rare Pokémon!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_trade_02_03",
      "hash64": "6C30F5D69AC9F703",
      "text": "You can’t trade Ms. Raifort a Shiny Pokémon!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_trade_03_00",
      "hash64": "1484CCCEFE4AD287",
      "text": "...Ah, but I see you only have one Pokémon along\\nwith you at the moment.\\c\\nYou would be wise to put at least two Pokémon\\nin your party before agreeing to a trade.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 163,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_trade_03_01",
      "hash64": "1484CBCEFE4AD0D4",
      "text": "History is full of deals refused and then later\\naccepted. I trust you’ll have a change of heart.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_trade_04_00",
      "hash64": "E2DFBAA54511C13C",
      "text": "So, how about you trade me one of your\\nPokémon for my Gimmighoul?[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_talkto_00",
      "hash64": "543004C7FA5D7610",
      "text": "I’ve been stuck indoors here for far too long.\\nThis...smell of newness is driving me mad.\\c\\nWhat do you say we head outdoors for a battle?[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 139,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_cancel_00",
      "hash64": "607BA6B2A8502F5B",
      "text": "Hm. I’d assumed you’d be more eager about this\\nsort of thing. Perhaps I shall head out alone.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_battlestart_00",
      "hash64": "648B51A4A41DB493",
      "text": "Heh heh... How very kind of you. Let’s make our\\nway to the battlefield, then.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_battlestart_01",
      "hash64": "648B50A4A41DB2E0",
      "text": "[EMPTY 59]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_battleend_win_00_00",
      "hash64": "1473B43FE834A998",
      "text": "You certainly are a worthy opponent. I see the\\npath you’ve walked is one of glory and power.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_battleend_win_00_01",
      "hash64": "1473B53FE834AB4B",
      "text": "Such strength... It would open all manner of ruins\\nand ancient tombs to me! If I could only secure\\r\\nyour cooperation...[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 121,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_battleend_win_00_02",
      "hash64": "1473B63FE834ACFE",
      "text": "Ah, of course... Here, I’ve got a gift for you. You\\nknow, out of the kindness of my heart.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_battleend_win_00_03",
      "hash64": "1473B73FE834AEB1",
      "text": "It’s very valuable, you know. Don’t forget to\\nthank me each night as you gaze upon it.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_reward_00",
      "hash64": "129A8A4084F2402C",
      "text": "[EMPTY 59]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
