          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 117,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_battleend_win_01_01",
      "hash64": "6950E935D8CC6B76",
      "text": "I certainly hope you treasure these little moments\\nspent with your dear teacher Raifort.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_battleend_lose_00_00",
      "hash64": "DED7809B5C71604B",
      "text": "Those with great strength often grow arrogant,\\nwhich in turn leads to their downfall.\\c\\nWere you trying to experience such a historical\\ntwist of fate yourself?[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 160,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_randomtalk_00",
      "hash64": "1E5F9A87D3C01CCA",
      "text": "Are you keeping those treasures of ruin under\\ncontrol?\\c\\nIf you ever feel the need to pass them on to\\nsomeone else, I’m always available.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 138,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_randomtalk_01",
      "hash64": "1E5F9B87D3C01E7D",
      "text": "Is it true that you entered the Great Crater of\\nPaldea?\\c\\nIf so, I may borrow some of your time to discuss\\nyour findings. Just a few days in my custody.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 153,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_randomtalk_02",
      "hash64": "1E5F9887D3C01964",
      "text": "I admit the Terarium is an impressive work of\\ntechnology, but...\\c\\nIt’s all twisted nature with no weight of history\\nbehind it. I find no joy in that, personally.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 163,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_randomtalk_03",
      "hash64": "1E5F9987D3C01B17",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Your [VAR 0x0101(0001)] is proving to be very\\nuseful,\\r\\njust\\r\\nas\\r\\nI\\r\\nhad\\r\\nexpected.\\c\\nIt has been a great help to my research and\\nexploration of ruins.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
