    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_randomtalk_04",
      "hash64": "1E5F9687D3C015FE",
      "text": "I enjoy collecting antiques and ancient artifacts.\\c\\nThe Gimmighoul I gave you was becoming a bit\\nof a problem, actually—it was always begging for\\r\\nold coins from my collection.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
